{
  "note": "Independent cost fixture (D352 change 4). Every expectedUsd was worked out by hand from the price table, NOT produced by any code in this repo; each case carries its arithmetic. Prices are USD per million tokens. A request whose whole input (input + cacheRead + cacheWrite) is above longContext.aboveInputTokens is billed entirely at the long-context rates. Reasoning is billed as output. outputOnlyUsd is what the wrong 'output tokens only' sum would give.",
